<title>UK: FEK sets 40 million sterling two-year bond.</title>
<headline>FEK sets 40 million sterling two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sanwa International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    40 MLN STG    COUPON     6.20	MATURITY    26.FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA    DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/FI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FINLAND   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
